    <string name="message_35d6f4944d" formatted="false">Projects: independent local projects, rename, file import.\nEdit: preview, timeline, playhead, split/trim/move/delete, Undo/Redo.\nMedia: source information and relink.\nDeliver: current 720-high SDR MP4 rendering and Gallery saving.\nFlow: a read-only explanation of the current preview/export route.\n\nPlanned: editable typed nodes, effects, compositing, grading, keyframes, audio graphs and RAW. These are not enabled in this build.\n\nThe local library is app-private and is lost on uninstall/data clear. Save important project documents externally and keep original media.</string>
