    <string name="message_4f099c46c1" formatted="false">Flow · current route (read-only)\n\nSource → native clip range / timeline position → MediaPlayer preview\nSource + timeline snapshot → Media3 decode/render/encode → validated MP4 → Gallery\n\nPreview and export currently use separate pipelines. This is not an editable node graph. Effects and rewiring are not available yet. Typed nodes, a shared evaluator, keyframes and compositing are planned in the architecture.</string>
